  "description": "What is outstanding and what is coming. Lateness is computed from the due date, never read from Schoology's own wording — that page labels work due in five days '4 days overdue'. Late and Unknown are two different questions and are counted separately: Late is what Schoology reports outstanding, Unknown is what it has never said anything about. Reading Late alone understates the picture, which is exactly what this board used to do.",
